WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.976
The customers who come back are worth rewarding.

00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:07.614
This video shows store credit, loyalty points and referrals:

00:00:07.614 --> 00:00:11.582
how to give them, how buyers spend them at checkout, and what they

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:13.070
see in their account.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:20.778
Winning a customer costs far more than keeping one.

00:00:20.778 --> 00:00:23.450
The ones who come back are worth rewarding.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.754
Three features do it.

00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:30.360
Store credit is money you owe a customer, such as a refund kept as credit.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.181
Loyalty points are earned on what they buy.

00:00:33.181 --> 00:00:36.060
Referrals reward them for bringing a friend.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:41.970
Each one pays toward later orders at checkout, after tax, like a gift card.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:48.620
They belong to a customer's account, so only signed in buyers earn and spend them.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.875
You give or take credit and points on the customer's page, with a

00:00:56.875 --> 00:00:58.360
reason that is kept.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:03.242
At checkout, a signed in buyer sees a box for each, and puts

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:04.870
it toward the order.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:11.450
Under My account, buyers see their credit, their rewards and their referral link.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:16.330
Settings, Commerce, Rewards and Referrals set the rules.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:24.573
Open Commerce, Customers, and open a customer with an account.

00:01:24.573 --> 00:01:29.690
Guests cannot be given credit, because credit is spent when the customer signs in.

00:01:30.453 --> 00:01:35.493
Under Store credit, enter an Amount, check the Currency, which starts with your

00:01:35.493 --> 00:01:39.406
checkout currency, and give a Reason, such as Late delivery.

00:01:39.406 --> 00:01:40.533
Click Change.

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:49.652
A positive amount gives credit, and a negative one takes it away.

00:01:49.652 --> 00:01:55.198
Every change is kept below, with when, what, the change and the balance after it.

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:59.405
Credit is kept for each currency, and never goes below zero.

00:02:03.671 --> 00:02:07.780
When you refund an order whose buyer has an account, the Refund form

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:10.891
on the order has a box to give it as store credit.

00:02:11.402 --> 00:02:15.408
Tick it, and the refund is added to the buyer's credit instead of

00:02:15.408 --> 00:02:17.158
going back to their card.

00:02:17.158 --> 00:02:21.108
The order counts it as refunded, and its notes say how much went

00:02:21.108 --> 00:02:22.632
back as store credit.

00:02:26.793 --> 00:02:31.215
On the Payment step, a signed in buyer with credit in the order's

00:02:31.215 --> 00:02:33.644
currency sees a Store credit box.

00:02:33.644 --> 00:02:38.003
Use my store credit puts it toward the order, up to what is due.

00:02:38.522 --> 00:02:42.157
The box shows how much is used and what is left, and the

00:02:42.157 --> 00:02:44.913
summary shows the credit under the total.

00:02:44.913 --> 00:02:49.252
Under My account, Store credit lists their balance and every change.

00:02:53.509 --> 00:02:56.070
Open Settings, Commerce, Rewards.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.565
Program name is what buyers see.

00:02:58.565 --> 00:03:03.425
Points per unit spent is how many points each dollar earns, on goods

00:03:03.425 --> 00:03:06.249
after discounts, not shipping or tax.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:11.285
What a point is worth is its value at checkout, so 0.01 makes

00:03:11.285 --> 00:03:13.587
100 points worth one dollar.

00:03:13.587 --> 00:03:19.139
Fewest points to spend is how many a buyer needs before they can spend them.

00:03:19.139 --> 00:03:20.290
Click Save.

00:03:20.837 --> 00:03:25.883
On a customer's page, the section named after your program shows their points

00:03:25.883 --> 00:03:27.707
and what they are worth.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.747
Enter Points and a Reason, and click Change.

00:03:35.027 --> 00:03:39.910
Under My account, Rewards shows the buyer's points, what they are worth, how

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.827
they earn and spend them, and every change.

00:03:43.325 --> 00:03:48.634
At checkout, Use my points pays toward the order, and only the points needed are spent.

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:52.688
Points are earned when the order is placed, taken back when it is

00:03:52.688 --> 00:03:56.285
canceled, and a matching share is taken back on a refund.

00:04:00.484 --> 00:04:03.023
Open Settings, Commerce, Referrals.

00:04:03.023 --> 00:04:06.738
What a friend gets is nothing, or one of your coupons.

00:04:06.738 --> 00:04:09.772
Each friend gets a single use code from it.

00:04:09.772 --> 00:04:15.344
Tick Only the generated codes work on that coupon, so its own code cannot be shared.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:22.406
What the customer gets is nothing, store credit, or loyalty points, for each friend's first order.

00:04:22.406 --> 00:04:26.592
Set the amount, and the least a friend's first order spends.

00:04:26.592 --> 00:04:27.670
Click Save.

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:35.831
Each signed in customer gets a referral link under Refer a friend in

00:04:35.831 --> 00:04:37.917
their account, with a Copy button.

00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:40.630
It shows what a friend gets and what they get.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.665
A friend who opens the link sees a welcome, with their discount waiting

00:04:46.665 --> 00:04:49.141
in the promotion code box at checkout.

00:04:49.141 --> 00:04:50.830
They can buy as a guest.

00:04:52.504 --> 00:04:57.079
When the friend's first order is placed, the customer is rewarded, once, and

00:04:57.079 --> 00:05:00.203
the reward is taken back if the order is canceled.

00:05:00.203 --> 00:05:04.890
The customer's account lists the friends who bought through the link, by first

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.954
name, with the reward for each.

00:05:11.154 --> 00:05:15.334
Make a customer whole after a late delivery with store credit.

00:05:16.084 --> 00:05:19.564
Refund as credit, so the money stays in your store.

00:05:20.314 --> 00:05:24.204
A rewards program that gives points on every order.

00:05:24.954 --> 00:05:29.994
Growth through friends, with a coupon for the friend and credit for the customer.

00:05:31.994 --> 00:05:37.380
Give credit, reward every order with points, and let customers bring their friends.

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.954
Thanks for watching.

